@startuml
title LAB3 修改预订时序：原占用参与核算
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
actor 顾客
participant OrdersPage
participant CommandExecutor
participant BookingService
participant PricingService
participant InventoryService
database SQLite
顾客 -> OrdersPage : 输入修改方案
OrdersPage -> BookingService : quote_modification(...)
BookingService -> PricingService : calculate(..., original_allocations)
PricingService --> OrdersPage : 新逐夜价格和总价
顾客 -> OrdersPage : 接受新报价
OrdersPage -> BookingService : modify(..., version, request_key)
BookingService -> CommandExecutor : execute(..., apply)
CommandExecutor -> SQLite : BEGIN IMMEDIATE / 解析会话 / 幂等检查
CommandExecutor -> BookingService : apply(connection, actor)
BookingService -> SQLite : 读取订单与酒店时区
alt 已到期
  BookingService -> InventoryService : release(...)
  BookingService -> SQLite : EXPIRED + 审计 + 通知待办
  BookingService --> CommandExecutor : 错误字典（不抛异常）
  CommandExecutor -> SQLite : 保存错误结果并提交
else 未到期
  BookingService -> BookingService : 检查归属、PENDING和version
  BookingService -> InventoryService : allocations(connection, id)
  BookingService -> PricingService : calculate(..., old)
  PricingService -> SQLite : 检查新方案的价格、余量、停售净变化
  BookingService -> InventoryService : replace(old, new)
  InventoryService -> SQLite : 逐日delta = new - old
  BookingService -> SQLite : 替换逐夜快照，更新订单与总价
  BookingService -> SQLite : version+1，expires_at = now+30分钟，审计
  BookingService --> CommandExecutor : 新订单结果
  CommandExecutor -> SQLite : 保存请求结果并提交
end
CommandExecutor --> OrdersPage : 成功 / 要求刷新
note over BookingService,SQLite
任一晚无房、报价改变或写入失败：原订单和库存不变。
停售日允许delta <= 0，不能增加原占用。
end note
@enduml
